{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乾隆元年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "右見　皇朝文典卷九十九　乾隆元年編修臣王峻恭擬"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊傳為東倉新橋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廟後同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又傳開運三年郡人以地易仁王院菜園建護國仁王院後改\n寶壽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "按記略載康熙辛卯年創山門至乾隆丁酉之冬始修關帝殿至是年因舊規模而\n更新"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "悅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "悅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "悅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "悅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即東房址"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楷書勒柱上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘不備錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "印曰七十一世孫四航海印"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八分書"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "右耳已失"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "按此志不知河年所葺今已失傳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從大殿庭\n左側廊而入"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊有七房內東房久廢地半歸寺內半歸西房"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "壬寅年入冊"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "野航戶下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "吳逢源付"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "吳逢源付"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "吳逢源付"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "吳起源付"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今有普同塔靜山和尚設"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "沈雲付"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "沈朴付"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "沈朴付"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "沈文御轉付"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "節錄捨書"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今挑空"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今挑空"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今常住收花"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "北首地上挑去泥土聽屠處畜養魚鱗水涸之日仍聽寺中挑泥應用"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "沈天生　顧捷三　陳元章　吳道深\n　許殿書　朱玉明　許爾調　裴際尤\n　張彥博"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "節錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "朱玉明　陳元章　馮昌期　沈天生\n　屠文英　高奕千　劉吉臣　道生師\n　大徹師　許殿臣　元章師　吳道深\n　蔣鼎彝　張際龍　吳存澧　爾昌師\n\n　松隱師　吳西林　恆先師　四航和尚\n　惟高師　勝瑢師　蔭寰和尚　悅山師\n　玉成師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "節錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孫茂昌　董治田　董天成　董楚山\n\n吳出雲　董尚周　屠聖高　住持雨畊"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "節錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "周青遠　鄔瑞卿　李錦章"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乾隆四十年由單"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見本寺記略"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "按語錄為侍者普兢編皆師住石門福巖餘杭龍泉及艮山崇福時法語"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "癸卯\n歲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甲辰歲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是年六月\n雨耕收"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彌勒殿額作達權"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已見住持"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺中銀杏樹自焚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "近扇子地"}
{"id": null, "n": "b006001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_b006001", "type": "orig", "text": "圖：北通下菩薩、蕩、田、菜園、門後、東、彌六樓、方丈、水月居、庫房、東房址入寺內、骨池、關帝廟、地、南、寺內地、寺前橋、中房、天王殿、大殿、祖堂、伽藍殿、祖師殿、禪堂、大悲閣、北、報本堂、齋堂、柴房、沐浴房、清房、東出范家衖通走馬塘、此處舊有雲水堂延壽堂今廢為隙庙。"}
{"id": null, "n": "b007001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_b007001", "type": "orig", "text": "圖：放生池、各房公產、西、西北房、東北房、南房、聞王廟、後殿、戲臺、花園衖村居、西房、井亭社、西達艮山門。"}
{"id": null, "n": "b001a0101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_b001a0101", "type": "add", "text": "此「版本說明」一文原為書本開頭無頁碼之插頁，今為標記架構上之需要移到此處，且以 pb001a 為虛擬頁欄碼。"}
{"id": null, "n": "b010a0401", "target": "#nkr_note_add_b010a0401", "type": "add", "text": "圮【CB】，𡉏【志彙】"}
{"id": null, "n": "b038a0901", "target": "#nkr_note_add_b038a0901", "type": "add", "text": "間【CB】，閒【志彙】"}
{"id": null, "n": "b060a0601", "target": "#nkr_note_add_b060a0601", "type": "add", "text": "間【CB】，閒【志彙】"}
{"id": null, "n": "b115a0801", "target": "#nkr_note_add_b115a0801", "type": "add", "text": "圮【CB】，𡉏【志彙】"}
